    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyuuth Yir-mɛ-yaa mëë cu jɛ dee näk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ tuk ruëc Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kim gat Yo-ci-yaa kuäär Juda, cu ruac ɛmɛ ben kä Kuoth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛmɛ ɛ jɛn min ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ la̱r ɣä wëë i̱, “Cuŋni rɛy kal luaak Kuɔth Nhial, kä ruacni kɛ ji̱ wi̱i̱ni Juda diaal tin la bä pal rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial, lät nikɛ rieet diaal tëë cä lar ɛn ɣöö bikɛ la̱t kɛ, /cu riet kɛl päl raar thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä dɔ̱ŋ bikɛ liɛŋ, a bi ramɔ rɔ ri̱t dupdɛ min jiääk, kä dëë mi jiääk in göörä ɣöö dëë lät kä kɛ, kɛ kui̱ lätnikiɛn tin jiäk cu päl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi kɛ jiök i̱, ‘Lat Kuoth Nhial ɛ ɛn ɣöö mi /ci yɛn ɣä bi liŋ, kä /ci yɛn bi guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni ŋuɔ̱tkä tin cä la̱th nhiamdun, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä /ci yɛn ruaacni ja̱a̱ŋnikä ni go̱o̱k tin la ja̱kä kä yɛ gua̱thni diaal bi liŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ɣän bä luak ɛmɛ jak kä ce̱tnikɛ dhɔr jɔɔkni, kä bä wec ɛmɛ jak kä kuëth rɛy dööri wec muɔ̱ɔ̱n diaal.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bööth palä kɛnɛ go̱o̱k kɛ nɛy diaal Yir-mɛ-yaa liŋ ɛ latdɛ kɛn rieet ti̱ti̱ diaal rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Yir-mɛ-yaa thuɔ̱k kɛ lat rieetni diaal tin ci Kuoth Nhial kɛ la̱r jɛ kɛ ɣöö bɛ kɛ la̱t nɛy diaal, cu bööth palä kɛnɛ go̱o̱k kɛ nɛy diaal jɛ käp wä kɛ i̱, “Ji̱n bi li̱w! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛŋu mɔ curi ruac go̱o̱kä lat ɔ kɛ ciöt Kuɔth Nhial wi̱i̱ i̱, ‘Bi luak ɛmɛ ce̱tnikɛ wec jɔɔkni, kä bi wec ɛmɛ te lutdä a bɛ thil nɛy ti bi cieŋ thi̱n’?” Kä cu nɛy diaal rɔ dol kɛ kui̱ Yir-mɛ-yaa rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci ruëëc Juda ti̱ti̱ liŋ, cukɛ jiɛɛn dhɔr kua̱r bä kɛ luaak Kuɔth Nhial, cukɛ ben nyuur thok luaak Kuɔth Nhial in pay la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bööth palä kɛnɛ go̱o̱k ruac kɛ ruëëc kɛnɛ nɛy diaal wä kɛ i̱, “Wut ɛmɛ ro̱ŋɛ nikɛ lia̱a̱, kɛ ɣöö cɛ ruac go̱o̱kä lat kɛ kui̱ wec ɛmɛ ce̱tnikɛ min ci yɛn ɛ liŋ nikɛ ji̱thkun.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yir-mɛ-yaa ruac kɛ ruëëc kɛnɛ nɛy diaal, wëë i̱, “Ci Kuoth Nhial ɣä ja̱k kɛ ɣöö bä ruac ce̱tnikɛ rieet diaal tin cia liŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ täämɛ rialɛ ciɛŋkun kɛnɛ lätkun ikä, kä luɔ̱thɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial min la Kuothdun, kä bɛ riɛk in cɛ lar i̱ bɛ lät kä yɛ päl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kui̱dä, ɣän ɛn ta̱a̱ tetnikun. La̱tdɛ ɣä kä mɔ guic yɛnɛ mɔ gɔaa kɛ yɛ ɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö mi wä yɛn ɣä näk, ŋa̱cɛ jɛ ɛn ɣöö cia rɔ̱ kɛ wec ɛmɛ kɛnɛ ji̱kɛ nöŋ riɛm raam mi kui̱c ŋu, kɛ thuɔ̱k ci Kuoth Nhial ɣä ja̱k kɛ ɣöö bä rieet ti diaal ti̱ti̱ ben lat ji̱thnikun.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ruëëc kɛnɛ nɛy diaal, bööth palä kɛnɛ go̱o̱k jiök i̱, “Ɛn wut ɛmɛ /cɛ ro̱ŋ kɛ lia̱a̱, kɛ ɣöö ruacɛ kɛ kɔn kɛ ciöt Kuɔth Nhial min la Kuothdan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ tekɛ bööth nath ti cua rɔ̱ jiɛc kä cukɛ ruac kɛ nɛy diaal tin ca rɔ̱ dol, wä kɛ i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tëë kɛ wut mi cɔal i̱ Mikaa raan Mo-rɛ-cɛth mi cu ruac go̱o̱kä lat kɛ ni̱n Ɣidh-ki-yaa kuäär Juda, cuɛ ji̱ Juda diaal jiök ɛn ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä cu Ɣidh-ki-yaa kuäär Juda kɛnɛ nɛy diaal jɛ näk? Kä /ken Ɣidh-ki-yaa dual kɛ Kuoth Nhial a bɛ wä go̱r ni gɔy kä Kuoth Nhial? Kä /ken Kuoth Nhial mëë jiääk ëë ɛ jɛn i̱ derɛ lät kä kɛ päl? Kä ɛn täämɛ no̱ŋ kɔn ni rɔ̱ riɛk.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ lɛ tekɛ ram mi dɔ̱ŋ mi cɔali U-ri-yaa gat Cɛ-mɛ̈-yaa raan Kir-yath-ya-rim cuɛ ruac go̱o̱kä lat kɛ ciöt Kuɔth Nhial. Cuɛ ruac go̱o̱kä lat kɛ kui̱ wec ɛmɛ niɛ mun ɛmɛ kɛ rieet ti ce̱tnikɛ rieet Yir-mɛ-yaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci kuäär ni Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kim kɛnɛ ji̱ köörɛ diaal kɛ ruëëc diaal rieet kɛ liŋ, cu kuäär ca̱r kɛ ɣöö bɛ jɛ näk. Duundɛ ɣöö mëë ci U-ri-yaa jɛ liŋ, cuɛ dual kä cuɛ rɔ bar kä I-jëp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär ni Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kim naath jäk kä I-jëp, Ɛl-na-than gat Ak-bor kɛ nɛy ti kɔ̱kiɛn kɛɛl kɛ jɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
